{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_10","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"nl -ba src/clj/dao/jing/dht/facade.clj; rg -n 'deftest|#\\\\?|private|array-map|need-cookie|sent|unacknowledged' test/dao/jing/dht_test.cljc test/dao/jing/dht/facade_test.clj test/dao/jing/dht/mesh.cljc\"","aggregated_output":"     1\t(ns dao.jing.dht.facade\n     2\t  \"The JVM blocking facade over a DHT composition\n     3\t   (docs/design/dao.jing.dht.md section 5.2). Host policy, JVM only,\n     4\t   optional; no portable code is written against it.\n     5\t\n     6\t   start! owns one driver thread: it is the DHT state's one step owner and\n     7\t   the tick adapter's cadence. Each turn it appends one\n     8\t   {:dao.lease/event :dao.lease/tick :dao.lease/reading ms} reading\n     9\t   (milliseconds since start, from the monotonic clock, so readings never\n    10\t   decrease) to the composition's :ticks, steps the state, and sleeps\n    11\t   :poll-interval-ms.\n    12\t\n    13\t   The returned handle is a dao.jing byte-store handle. Its put-bytes-fn\n    14\t   is dao.jing.dht/store-handle's: the local verdict, at once, never\n    15\t   waiting for the acknowledgement. Its get-bytes-fn reads :local and, on\n    16\t   a miss, issues :jing/get through dao.jing.content.driver, which waits to\n    17\t   its own request deadline (:request-timeout-ms) while the driver thread\n    18\t   steps the DHT; the verified bytes are then in :local as well.\n    19\t\n    20\t   The composition's :ticks must also be a writer (a ring owner handle\n    21\t   is), and :requests and :answers are the pair the content driver speaks\n    22\t   over.\"\n    23\t  (:require [dao.jing.content.driver :as driver]\n    24\t            [dao.jing.content.step :as step]\n    25\t            [dao.jing.dht :as dht]\n    26\t            [dao.stream :as stream]))\n    27\t\n    28\t\n    29\t(def default-poll-interval-ms\n    30\t  \"How long the driver thread sleeps between steps, in milliseconds.\"\n    31\t  5)\n    32\t\n    33\t\n    34\t(def default-budget\n    35\t  \"Each step's per-stage budget.\"\n    36\t  64)\n    37\t\n    38\t\n    39\t(defn start!\n    40\t  \"Start a DHT driver thread over `composition` and return its blocking\n    41\t   dao.jing handle {:local :put-bytes-fn :get-bytes-fn :close-fn :thread}.\n    42\t   Options: :poll-interval-ms, :budget, and the content driver's\n    43\t   :request-timeout-ms. close-fn stops and joins the thread, then closes\n    44\t   the request pair and :local.\"\n    45\t  ([composition] (start! composition {}))\n    46\t  ([composition {:keys [poll-interval-ms budget request-timeout-ms]\n    47\t                 :or {poll-interval-ms default-poll-interval-ms\n    48\t                      budget default-budget}}]\n    49\t   (let [initial (dht/state composition)\n    50\t         {:keys [local requests answers ticks]} composition\n    51\t         _ (when-not (stream/writer? ticks)\n    52\t             (throw (ex-info \"the facade appends ticks: :ticks must be a writer\"\n    53\t                             {})))\n    54\t         store (dht/store-handle\n    55\t                 {:local local\n    56\t                  :requests requests\n    57\t                  :max-message-bytes (::dht/max-message-bytes initial)})\n    58\t         client (driver/driver\n    59\t                  (step/client-state requests answers\n    60\t                                     (:dao.stream/cursor\n    61\t                                       (stream/cursor answers\n    62\t                                                      :dao.stream/newest)))\n    63\t                  (cond-> {:poll-interval-ms 1}\n    64\t                    request-timeout-ms (assoc :request-timeout-ms\n    65\t                                              request-timeout-ms)))\n    66\t         running (atom true)\n    67\t         origin (System/nanoTime)\n    68\t         thread (Thread.\n    69\t                  ^Runnable\n    70\t                  (fn []\n    71\t                    (loop [state initial]\n    72\t                      (when @running\n    73\t                        (stream/append! ticks\n    74\t                                        {:dao.lease/event :dao.lease/tick\n    75\t                                         :dao.lease/reading\n    76\t                                         (quot (- (System/nanoTime) origin)\n    77\t                                               1000000)})\n    78\t                        (let [state (dht/step state budget)]\n    79\t                          (when (try (Thread/sleep ^long poll-interval-ms)\n    80\t                                     true\n    81\t                                     (catch InterruptedException _ false))\n    82\t                            (recur state))))))\n    83\t                  \"dao.jing.dht.facade\")\n    84\t         absent (Object.)\n    85\t         closed (atom false)]\n    86\t     (.setDaemon thread true)\n    87\t     (.start thread)\n    88\t     {:local local\n    89\t      :thread thread\n    90\t      :put-bytes-fn (:put-bytes-fn store)\n    91\t      :get-bytes-fn\n    92\t      (fn [address not-found]\n    93\t        (let [bs ((:get-bytes-fn local) address absent)]\n    94\t          (if (identical? absent bs)\n    95\t            ((:get-bytes-fn client) address not-found)\n    96\t            bs)))\n    97\t      :close-fn\n    98\t      (fn []\n    99\t        (when (compare-and-set! closed false true)\n   100\t          (reset! running false)\n   101\t          (.interrupt thread)\n   102\t          (.join thread)\n   103\t          ((:close-fn client))\n   104\t          ((:close-fn store))))})))\ntest/dao/jing/dht/mesh.cljc:154:  #?(:cljd (.-length bs)\ntest/dao/jing/dht/mesh.cljc:159:(defn sent\ntest/dao/jing/dht_test.cljc:9:  (:require [clojure.test :refer [deftest is testing]]\ntest/dao/jing/dht_test.cljc:86:       (catch #?(:cljd Object :clj Exception :cljs :